// Jungle Academy's menu, games and services, shared by the desktop and
// Android hosts. Each game is its own .zx bundle in games/, run through
// Kryon's app host, with its saves in the person's data folder. Games may ask
// the app to play their sounds, to turn a painted canvas into a picture, and
// to go back to this menu.
